commit highkinFlourishes
  npc/sable :: a Smith
  npc/sable . role = "bronzeworker of highkin; first apprentice on the ninefathom copper"
  npc/sable `belongsTo` culture/highkin
  npc/sable `worksAt` mine/ninefathom
  npc/sable `apprenticesUnder` path/bronzework

  culture/highkin . state = "flourishing"
  culture/highkin `tradesWith` culture/riverfolk